WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.869
Diphthongs are vowel sounds that glide, as in day, time and boy.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.964
Which word has the /oi/ sound? Answer: coin

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:12.346
Sort ten spoken words into day, time and boy sound groups.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.973
Discuss why: Coin contains /oi/.
